/-- The arms in variant order: as many arms as variants, each variant named by exactly one. Only one arm runs, so the order they are written in has no effect. With a wildcard arm `_ -> value` last, every other arm names a variant, no variant is named twice, and the variants no arm names (at least one, so the wildcard's value is read) take the wildcard's arm. laniusc runs the first arm that matches, so an arm after a wildcard never runs; a wildcard is read only as the last arm. -/
def armsInOrder (fuel : Nat) (owner : TypeDecl) (variants : List VariantTy) (arms : List CTree) : Option (List CTree) :=
